Getch, LoadI Chptr
Skipcond 400
Jump Outp
Halt
Outp, Output
Load Chptr
Add One
Store Chptr
Jump Getch
One, HEX 0001
Chptr, HEX 10B
String, DEC 072
DEC 101
DEC 108
DEC 108
DEC 111
DEC 032
DEC 119
DEC 111
DEC 114
DEC 108
DEC 100
DEC 033
DEC 000
